    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m"{% if termsWithAnchors %} id="misuse" tabindex="-1"{% endif %}>If you misuse HMPPS Digital Services</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">Unauthorised or inappropriate access, use or sharing of information in HMPPS Digital Services is treated as gross misconduct. It could result in disciplinary action, criminal investigation and prosecution.</p>
    <p class="govuk-body">If you suspect someone is misusing HMPPS Digital Services you should report this straight away on the <a class="govuk-link" href="https://justiceuk.sharepoint.com/sites/HMPPSIntranet/SitePages/Counter-corruption-and-wrongdoing.aspx?web=1&amp;or=WORD-WEB.BODY.NT&amp;ct=1791455110846&amp;ct=1791896424600" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Counter corruption intranet page</a> or telephone 0800 917 6877.</p>

